    "notes": {
        "8590746d-9edd-46b7-b976-f05cd35a7bed": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 640,
            "width": 900,
            "height": 260,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nBoth lanes are scoped to `E2E-Delta-Triggers/UpdatedFile` in the **Documents** library of the **Stg Appmixer QA**\nSharePoint site. Create that folder with `appmixer.microsoft.sharepoint.CreateFolder`\n(parent path `E2E-Delta-Triggers`) on a fresh tenant.\n\nTiming is load-bearing and the Waits must not be removed:\n- `Wait 1m` lets the Graph subscription propagate before the file is created.\n- `Wait 3m` lets the trigger consume the *creation* delta and advance its `lastUpdated`\n  watermark. `UpdatedFile` only emits files whose `createdDateTime` is older than that\n  watermark, so renaming too early emits nothing and the flow times out.\n\nCleanup deletes the item id the trigger reported — nothing else may write text files into\nthat folder while the flow runs.\n\nThe account needs `Files.Read.All`, `Sites.Read.All`, `Subscription.Read.All` (trigger),\n`Files.ReadWrite.All` (upload) and `Sites.ReadWrite.All` (Make API Call)."
        }
    }
